---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { config } from '../config';
const analyticsOn = !!config.analytics.provider;
---
<Page title="Privacy" lead="What this site does with your data, which is very little." description="Privacy notice for The Consulting Room website.">
  <p>Last updated: October 15, 2026.</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>The data controller for this website is Dott. Alberto Del Bove, Via Luigi Pirandello 8, 04020 Itri (LT), Italy, <a href="mailto:alberto.delbove.psicoterapeuta@gmail.com">alberto.delbove.psicoterapeuta@gmail.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>This website sets no cookies and uses no advertising or tracking tools, which is why there is no cookie banner.</p>
  {analyticsOn ? (
    <p>To count visits, the site uses a cookieless statistics service ({config.analytics.provider === 'plausible' ? 'Plausible Analytics' : 'GoatCounter'}). It records aggregate figures such as page views and referring sites, stores no cookies and does not identify individual visitors.</p>
  ) : (
    <p>The site does not use any analytics service.</p>
  )}

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is a set of static pages served by GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc.). Like any web server, the host processes your IP address and technical request data to deliver the pages and protect the service, under its own privacy policy.</p>

  <h2>Purchases happen on Etsy</h2>
  <p>This site sells nothing directly. When you follow a link to Etsy, you leave this site, and any purchase, account or payment data is handled by Etsy under the <a href="https://www.etsy.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Etsy Privacy Policy</a>. As a seller I receive from Etsy only the order details Etsy shares with sellers.</p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>If you write to me, I use your address and message only to reply, and I keep the correspondence no longer than needed for that purpose.</p>
  {config.newsletter.enabled && (
    <>
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <p>If you subscribe, your email address is stored by the newsletter provider <span class="placeholder">[DA COMPLETARE: nome del servizio]</span> on the basis of your consent. You receive a confirmation email first, and nothing is sent until you confirm. You can unsubscribe from any email, and your address is then deleted.</p>
    </>
  )}

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the EU General Data Protection Regulation you can ask for access to, correction or deletion of your personal data, object to its processing, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority (in Italy, the Garante per la protezione dei dati personali). Residents of US states with privacy laws, such as California, have comparable rights. To exercise any of them, write to the address above.</p>
</Page>
